<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/Alt (Representation, projection, blend. One: nested ellipses around a center, where the weight is 1 at the center, 0.61 at one sigma and 0.14 at two sigma, and the drawn bell stops at about 2.8 sigma. Two: the ellipsoid is flattened to an ellipse on the screen by a straight-line stand-in at its center. Three: a far splat is drawn first and a near splat over it.)
